WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.101 --> 00:00:04.632
Cora held up some plants.

2
00:00:04.633 --> 00:00:07.600
"Let's take these to Sandy Bottom, Mo."

3
00:00:07.601 --> 00:00:11.170
Mo's eyes went wide. "No way!

4
00:00:11.171 --> 00:00:14.731
The lobsters live there."

5
00:00:14.732 --> 00:00:17.112
"That's right!" Cora said.

6
00:00:17.113 --> 00:00:20.006
"We can give the plants to them.

7
00:00:20.007 --> 00:00:23.268
The lobsters love these plants."

8
00:00:23.269 --> 00:00:27.725
"I stay away from lobsters," Mo said.

9
00:00:27.726 --> 00:00:29.758
"They have big claws.

10
00:00:29.759 --> 00:00:32.155
And they can pinch!"

11
00:00:32.156 --> 00:00:37.991
Cora laughed. "Don't be scared.

12
00:00:37.992 --> 00:00:41.793
Come on. Let's go.

13
00:00:41.794 --> 00:00:44.727
The lobsters are friendly."

14
00:00:44.728 --> 00:00:50.442
Mo frowned. "We'll see about that."

15
00:00:50.443 --> 00:00:53.717
Cora and Mo swam to Sandy Bottom.

16
00:00:53.718 --> 00:00:58.451
But they didn't see the lobsters.

17
00:00:58.452 --> 00:01:01.969
"Something's wrong," Cora said.

18
00:01:01.970 --> 00:01:06.139
"The lobsters are gone."

19
00:01:06.140 --> 00:01:09.783
Cora and Mo searched for them.

20
00:01:09.784 --> 00:01:20.015
They looked under sand and rocks.

21
00:01:20.016 --> 00:01:23.563
"I saw that hammerhead shark yesterday," Mo said.

22
00:01:23.564 --> 00:01:26.758
"Maybe he ate the lobsters!"

23
00:01:26.759 --> 00:01:30.393
"I hope not," Cora said.

24
00:01:30.394 --> 00:01:35.415
"Let's see if the compass can find them."

25
00:01:35.416 --> 00:01:39.622
Cora opened the compass shell with her ink.

26
00:01:39.623 --> 00:01:43.774
The picture showed the lobsters.

27
00:01:43.775 --> 00:01:46.461
"Oh no!" Cora said.

28
00:01:46.462 --> 00:01:50.433
"They're caught in a fisherman's trap!"

29
00:01:50.434 --> 00:01:52.187
The arrow took off.

30
00:01:52.188 --> 00:01:58.051
Cora flew after it. "Come on, Mo!"

